            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"siguientes-pasos\">\ud83d\udca1 Siguientes Pasos:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Carga tus datos reales</strong>: Reemplaza el DataFrame de ejemplo</li>\n<li><strong>Explora</strong>: Marimo recalcula autom\u00e1ticamente cuando cambias c\u00f3digo</li>\n<li><strong>A\u00f1ade m\u00e1s celdas</strong>: Click en el bot\u00f3n + para agregar an\u00e1lisis</li>\n<li><strong>Exporta</strong>: Usa <code>marimo export analysis.py</code> para HTML est\u00e1tico</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"comandos-utiles\">Comandos \u00fatiles:</h3>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># Leer CSV</span>\n<span class=\"n\">df</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">pl</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read_csv</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;data/archivo.csv&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Leer Parquet (muy r\u00e1pido)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">df</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">pl</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read_parquet</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;data/archivo.parquet&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Leer Excel</span>\n<span class=\"n\">df</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">pl</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read_excel</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;data/archivo.xlsx&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
